<title>USA: NY cert cotton stocks drop 4,447 bales to 98,559.</title>
<headline>NY cert cotton stocks drop 4,447 bales to 98,559.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Aug 1 totaled 98,559 bales, down from 103,006 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 4,447 cancellations, and 401 decertification orders. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
